<title>UK: Horlick says reinstatement at MGAM not very likely.</title>
<headline>Horlick says reinstatement at MGAM not very likely.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former Morgan Grenfell Asset Management (MGAM) fund manager Nicola Horlick said on Tuesday that the chances of her being reinstated were slim.</p>
<p>&quot;Reinstatement doesn't seem very likely,&quot; she told Reuters after a brief meeting with her lawyer.</p>
</text>
